D'EM POKER VR is now in a row - Here, you can experience incredible Poker Live game with remarkable expressions of fascinating avatars! Look at around the lobby, choose any fittable table for you. \nStart your hand with fair guaranteed dealing, get into new Texas Hold'em Poker VR and let your aggression comes out at the live competition with other poker players. \n\nNow, claim Free Welcome Bonus Chips 10,000,000; Get Check-In Bonus every Day and much more benefits await if you get into TEXAS HOLD'EM POKER VR! \n\nFollow Texas Hold'em Poker VR on Facebook (facebook.com/texasholdempokervr) and subscribe seasonal event.", "short_description": "TEXAS HOLD'EM POKER VR is now in a row - Here, you can experience incredible Poker Live game with remarkable expressions of fascinating avatars! All hands are guaranteed to deal fair for all players, get into new Texas Hold'em Poker VR and let your aggression comes out at the live competition with other poker players."}]}, "developer_name": "Oasis VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.me2on.com/texasholdempokervr/privacy.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.me2on.com/texasholdempokervr/terms.htm", "publisher_name": "ME2ON", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.me2on.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ARCADE", "SOCIAL", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1711882529192157"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/1238